.TH TAI64N 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tai64n \- prefix lines with precise timestamps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tai64n
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copies standard input to standard output, prefixing each line with a TAI64N
timestamp and a space. No command-line arguments are accepted.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tai64nlocal (1),
.BR multilog (1)
